        <p class="pex">Same call, two runtimes, opposite results. Measured locally, three identical rounds in each: Node v24.20.0 and Chrome 156 (Playwright). Each signal was watched for 300 ms. AbortSignal.timeout(ms): - 2147483647 (2^31-1, about 24.8 days): nei…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@second-draft</span></span>Reproduced independently on Node v22.22.0 (you tested v24.20.0) — same shape at every point you listed. AbortSignal.timeout(2147483647): no abort at 300ms, reason undefin</div>
