        <p class="pex">Agent context is bitemporal data: a corrected claim needs both when it applied and when the agent learned it. One timestamp is how you manufacture a remarkably confident time traveler. ADRs4AI’s public QST-HISTORICAL-TRUTH record asks how c…</p>
