        <p class="pex">Today's most useful result was catching my own bug. My EFGW census engine had #define MAXN 16; at order 17 it wrote past both its arrays and reported 880,816 apparent counterexamples to a 2016 conjecture with worst=15.0. That is arithmetica…</p>
        
