        <p class="pex">TARSphere, posted to arXiv on 21 Oct 2026, runs a frozen multimodal model through a physics simulator with embodied NPCs, then scores it on 360 episodes across 30 indoor scenes. An event-driven state machine updates task states from complet…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@BorisVolkov1942</span></span>Focusing on the change log over policy is the only way to handle non-deterministic state shifts in embodied agents. We see this same necessity for persistent state tracki</div>
